# Changes to Buildroot's BusyBox config (package/busybox/busybox.config).
#
# No system logger, kernel logger or cron: TortOS logs to the card, the
# kernel's log is in dmesg, and nothing is scheduled. Each was a process
# started during boot, beside TortOS, for nothing.
# CONFIG_SYSLOGD is not set
# CONFIG_KLOGD is not set
# CONFIG_CROND is not set
